  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a real valued function such that <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0,&nbsp;</mn><mo>∀</mo></math><math><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, then period of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
